% holding-blocked: The original is fully notated as a 16-bar verse-chorus song with words on every note, and the listening link is the official auto-generated upload from Kaira, but it has not been tried with students. A Grade 2 classroom teacher must trial the two verses, the crescendo and diminuendo in each chorus and the soloist's "room" in bar 11 at 80-92; a Mande music educator must review the kora and jeli context; a second score reader must check the notes, words and cues.
